            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Laura Radde"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was great! I bought fresh broccoli floweretts at the bulk food store and chopped them. I also substituted Splenda for the sugar to use in our low-carb diet. My husband really loved it",
            "datePublished": "2002-08-31T13:08:07.670Z"
          },
          {
